WEBVTT

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.581
Hiroki!

00:00:57.791 --> 00:00:58.951
Hiroki...

00:02:39.893 --> 00:02:41.190
Are you all right?

00:02:41.227 --> 00:02:42.421
Yes, I am now.

00:02:42.462 --> 00:02:44.828
So, how was it?

00:02:44.864 --> 00:02:47.298
Your rendezvous with Sakura
inside your dream.

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:50.029
W-Well...

00:02:50.069 --> 00:02:52.060
Sakura kissed you,
you know.

00:02:52.105 --> 00:02:53.265
What?

00:02:55.742 --> 00:02:58.677
Jeez, you guys
are so annoying!

00:02:58.711 --> 00:03:00.440
Even if you say that...

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:03.711
Kureha, cut it out.

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:05.684
Ranmaru, please tell us
the details.

00:03:08.555 --> 00:03:09.988
A weird guy?

00:03:10.023 --> 00:03:13.015
Yeah. He gave off
a really bad feeling.

00:03:13.059 --> 00:03:14.720
That's probably Taishi.

00:03:14.761 --> 00:03:15.955
Taishi?

00:03:15.995 --> 00:03:18.190
You might call him the mastermind
behind all this.

00:03:18.231 --> 00:03:21.428
He works as a go-between
for the humans and the phantoms.

00:03:22.502 --> 00:03:26.632
He's interfered in our plans
time and time again.

00:03:26.673 --> 00:03:28.903
He has diplomatic immunity,

00:03:28.942 --> 00:03:31.069
but we don't know his nationality
or where he's from.

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:33.169
What does that mean?

00:03:33.213 --> 00:03:36.046
I guess it might mean
that he's not human.

00:03:38.117 --> 00:03:41.678
We've tried to get a lead on him
several times, but...

00:03:41.721 --> 00:03:43.211
He slips through our fingers.

00:03:45.091 --> 00:03:48.060
I can still feel his hands on me.

00:03:48.094 --> 00:03:51.154
I couldn't feel any warmth at all.

00:03:51.197 --> 00:03:53.290
It was like it was reptilian
or something.

00:03:53.333 --> 00:03:55.198
Like a phantom?

00:04:02.108 --> 00:04:03.097
Where are you calling?

00:04:03.142 --> 00:04:05.110
The Utagawa precinct.

00:04:05.144 --> 00:04:07.977
Oh, hello? This is Shindo
from the second division.

00:04:08.014 --> 00:04:11.006
Could you get Lieutenant Muramasa
from the S.M.I.F. For me, please?

00:04:12.385 --> 00:04:14.512
What? He's out?

00:04:14.554 --> 00:04:15.714
I understand.

00:04:15.755 --> 00:04:16.744
Muramasa?

00:04:16.789 --> 00:04:19.121
He was my superior
when I was in the S.M.I.F.

00:04:19.158 --> 00:04:23.618
Mr. Muramasa is the one
that took me to that guy.

00:04:23.663 --> 00:04:27.121
In any case, I'll go to that guy's
mansion one more time.

00:04:27.166 --> 00:04:28.895
It's no use.

00:04:28.935 --> 00:04:31.403
He probably vanished already.

00:04:31.437 --> 00:04:33.132
And it's too dangerous, too.

00:04:33.172 --> 00:04:36.972
Presently, not even the government
can lay a hand on him.

00:04:38.645 --> 00:04:41.705
And furthermore, Ranmaru,
starting tomorrow...

00:04:41.748 --> 00:04:43.943
...you don't have to go
to the Utagawa precinct anymore.

00:04:43.983 --> 00:04:44.972
What? But...

00:04:45.018 --> 00:04:47.987
Leave Muramasa to Ryouko.

00:04:53.493 --> 00:04:55.757
And now, onto the next topic.

00:04:55.795 --> 00:04:58.286
The gloomy weather
has continued into today.

00:04:58.331 --> 00:04:59.399
But despite the rain,
an event is being held...

00:04:59.399 --> 00:05:00.696
But despite the rain,
an event is being held...
Big brother.

00:05:00.733 --> 00:05:01.401
...in the Shonan area.
Huh?

00:05:01.401 --> 00:05:01.868
...in the Shonan area.
Huh?

00:05:01.868 --> 00:05:02.368
...in the Shonan area.
Don't 'huh' me.

00:05:02.368 --> 00:05:03.835
Don't 'huh' me.

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:05.997
Why don't you have to go
into work?

00:05:06.039 --> 00:05:09.099
Well, a lot has happened.

00:05:09.142 --> 00:05:12.373
I've been wondering about this
since you got transferred...

00:05:12.412 --> 00:05:15.108
...but what is with that outfit?

00:05:15.148 --> 00:05:16.240
How's it look on me?

00:05:16.282 --> 00:05:18.375
You look like a biker punk.

00:05:18.418 --> 00:05:20.750
What? Really?

00:05:24.023 --> 00:05:26.583
Don't tell me that you caused
some kind of scandal...

00:05:26.626 --> 00:05:28.890
...and now you're suspended.

00:05:28.928 --> 00:05:30.589
There's no way
that would happen.

00:05:31.531 --> 00:05:32.896
You're being suspicious.

00:05:32.932 --> 00:05:34.490
Hey, now.

00:05:35.768 --> 00:05:36.757
Thank goodness.

00:05:36.803 --> 00:05:37.963
Huh?

00:05:38.004 --> 00:05:40.598
You're back to your old self.

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:42.608
Oh, it's coming this way!
What'll we do?

00:05:42.608 --> 00:05:43.609
Oh, it's coming this way!
What'll we do?
Saya...

00:05:43.609 --> 00:05:44.098
Oh, it's coming this way!
What'll we do?

00:05:44.143 --> 00:05:47.112
Tokyo Police Hospital
Utagawa Police Hospital

00:06:08.067 --> 00:06:09.398
Yeah, yeah...

00:06:09.435 --> 00:06:11.767
This is the Shibuya S.M.I.F.

00:06:12.905 --> 00:06:15.237
What!? Yoyogi Park!?

00:06:18.711 --> 00:06:22.147
Shindo... you're really...

00:06:22.181 --> 00:06:24.012
Damn it!

00:06:24.917 --> 00:06:26.782
Hey, what are you doing?
We're moving out.

00:06:26.819 --> 00:06:28.377
Y-Yes, sir.

00:06:46.939 --> 00:06:49.499
Damn, they can regenerate.

00:06:49.542 --> 00:06:51.669
These are different
from the usual ones.

00:06:51.711 --> 00:06:53.872
It looks like they got stronger
before they came here.

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:02.051
There's no end to this.

00:07:02.088 --> 00:07:05.057
At a time like this, all we have to do
is go for the main body, right?

00:07:05.091 --> 00:07:07.685
Right! You've got it,
don't you?

00:07:07.727 --> 00:07:09.957
So who has the detector?

00:07:09.996 --> 00:07:11.964
Ryouko is off today.

00:07:11.998 --> 00:07:13.056
What?

00:07:13.099 --> 00:07:14.157
Shindo!

00:07:17.503 --> 00:07:19.437
Damn.

00:07:19.472 --> 00:07:20.666
Are you all right?

00:07:20.706 --> 00:07:21.695
What about you?

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:26.276
Damn it. In that case...

00:07:26.312 --> 00:07:27.540
What are you doing?

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:30.879
I'm going to try to sense...
the main body's aura...

00:07:40.827 --> 00:07:42.226
There!

00:07:50.303 --> 00:07:52.271
His power is incredible,
as always.

00:07:57.844 --> 00:07:59.311
It can't be!

00:08:07.086 --> 00:08:09.054
W-Why you...

00:08:14.393 --> 00:08:15.382
Hiroki...

00:08:15.428 --> 00:08:16.918
What?

00:08:19.332 --> 00:08:22.824
Hiroki... why are you
in a place like this?

00:08:25.104 --> 00:08:28.267
Rokujo! Wait, that's...

00:08:38.985 --> 00:08:41.078
It's all or nothing...

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:42.815
Inukai!

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:45.116
What are you trying to do?

00:08:45.157 --> 00:08:47.751
Just like when it happened
to you...

00:08:47.793 --> 00:08:50.591
Those aren't the eyes
of a phantom yet...

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:52.860
We're going to retrieve
his captured soul!

00:08:55.334 --> 00:08:56.358
All right!

00:09:06.045 --> 00:09:07.137
Sakura?

00:09:07.179 --> 00:09:09.340
Leave this to me...

00:09:11.183 --> 00:09:12.514
Be careful.

00:09:32.405 --> 00:09:33.565
Hiroki.

00:09:34.974 --> 00:09:37.909
I had waited for you all this time,
and yet...

00:09:37.944 --> 00:09:40.879
...you didn't save me,
big sister...

00:09:40.913 --> 00:09:45.612
Papa and mama were killed too.

00:09:52.024 --> 00:09:53.116
I'm sorry.

00:09:59.832 --> 00:10:01.299
Wait!

00:10:04.971 --> 00:10:06.700
Rokujo!

00:10:14.814 --> 00:10:17.248
You bastard!
You're not human!?

00:10:25.358 --> 00:10:26.347
Damn it!

00:10:26.392 --> 00:10:27.757
Shindo...

00:10:27.793 --> 00:10:29.226
Rokujo!

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:38.759
It's him!

00:10:38.804 --> 00:10:41.432
So he really was being controlled
by Taishi!

00:10:48.514 --> 00:10:49.503
Hmph.

00:10:49.548 --> 00:10:50.708
Shindo...

00:10:51.617 --> 00:10:53.278
Hanazono...

00:10:55.955 --> 00:10:57.923
Shindo...

00:10:57.957 --> 00:10:59.083
You...

00:10:59.125 --> 00:11:01.116
Mr. Kunikida...

00:11:05.598 --> 00:11:07.395
Oh, Mr. Muramasa!

00:11:23.683 --> 00:11:26.208
Things would have been bad
if it had gone in any deeper.

00:11:26.252 --> 00:11:29.585
Man, you walked
straight up to him.

00:11:29.622 --> 00:11:30.953
There, finished.

00:11:34.527 --> 00:11:35.687
Rokujo!

00:11:37.029 --> 00:11:39.827
Are you really all right?

00:11:39.865 --> 00:11:44.234
Don't worry. There's hope.

00:11:44.270 --> 00:11:46.704
In any case, rest for a while.

00:11:51.477 --> 00:11:53.468
That was dangerous.

00:11:56.348 --> 00:11:58.441
He was smiling.

00:11:58.484 --> 00:12:01.453
A symbiont
that's been taken over...

00:12:01.487 --> 00:12:04.285
...isn't supposed
to have a human heart.

00:12:04.323 --> 00:12:09.056
That's why it's not possible for them
to show emotions.

00:12:09.095 --> 00:12:13.896
Hiroki was smiling.
It was as if he felt sorry for us.

00:12:15.401 --> 00:12:17.801
I wonder what it could mean.

00:12:17.837 --> 00:12:19.327
It couldn't be...

00:12:22.374 --> 00:12:24.433
Where are you going?

00:12:24.477 --> 00:12:25.739
I'm going to go look for Hiroki!

00:12:25.778 --> 00:12:27.109
Rokujo!

00:12:27.146 --> 00:12:29.137
There's no way,
the condition you're in.

00:12:30.816 --> 00:12:32.477
But Hiroki might...

00:12:32.518 --> 00:12:34.486
Still have a human heart?

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:35.509
What?

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:39.485
Even if that's the case...

00:12:39.525 --> 00:12:40.856
Get out of the way.

00:12:40.893 --> 00:12:43.555
Hiroki attacked us.

00:12:46.232 --> 00:12:49.497
And if he does have a distinct
consciousness,

00:12:49.535 --> 00:12:51.867
it makes things
more difficult for us.

00:12:51.904 --> 00:12:53.895
Rokujo, I'm coming too.

00:12:53.939 --> 00:12:56.407
Shindo?

00:12:56.442 --> 00:12:59.275
Kureha, there's nothing to worry
about if I go along, right?

00:12:59.311 --> 00:13:01.575
If something happens,
then I can follow up.

00:13:02.581 --> 00:13:07.075
And besides, Hiroki might be
how I was before.

00:13:09.288 --> 00:13:10.619
If that's the case, then...

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:15.795
Password entry necessary

00:13:15.795 --> 00:13:17.262
Please enter your password
Password entry necessary

00:13:21.534 --> 00:13:23.263
Working late, aren't we?

00:13:24.303 --> 00:13:25.895
Inspector Ibuki.

00:13:25.938 --> 00:13:27.530
What are you doing?

00:13:27.573 --> 00:13:29.632
I'm taking care
of some case files.

00:13:29.675 --> 00:13:31.040
Don't move!

00:13:31.076 --> 00:13:34.273
Take your hands off
of that slowly.

00:13:37.449 --> 00:13:38.541
Are you one of Taishi's spies?

00:13:38.584 --> 00:13:40.142
What are you talking about?

00:13:40.186 --> 00:13:44.054
You're able to get your hands
on all the information here.

00:13:44.089 --> 00:13:47.786
You even seem to have contacts
in the second division.

00:13:47.827 --> 00:13:49.886
What do you want from me?

00:13:49.929 --> 00:13:53.057
Simple.
Tell me where Taishi is.

00:13:53.098 --> 00:13:55.828
Taishi? Who's that?

00:13:55.868 --> 00:13:58.564
Sorry, but I'm serious.

00:13:58.604 --> 00:14:00.731
Can you shoot me?

00:14:00.773 --> 00:14:01.797
Care to try me?

00:14:02.775 --> 00:14:05.835
Even if you do,
nothing will change.

00:14:05.878 --> 00:14:10.815
You should know by now,
it's too late for anything.

00:14:23.128 --> 00:14:25.460
It doesn't matter
if it's too late.

00:14:25.497 --> 00:14:28.432
I'm going to exterminate
them all.

00:14:34.473 --> 00:14:36.805
And in the end,
we ended up here.

00:14:39.511 --> 00:14:42.844
Why didn't you try to get out
of the way?

00:14:42.882 --> 00:14:43.974
It's my fault.

00:14:44.016 --> 00:14:45.540
What?

00:14:45.584 --> 00:14:48.280
That Hiroki got attacked
by them.

00:14:49.521 --> 00:14:52.319
Hey, big sister.
Take me with you.

00:14:52.358 --> 00:14:55.327
I can't, Hiroki. Your fever
still hasn't gone down.

00:14:55.361 --> 00:15:00.196
It's all right.
Today's my birthday, after all.

00:15:00.232 --> 00:15:02.291
No, be good.

00:15:02.334 --> 00:15:05.303
I'll be sure to buy you
a present.

00:15:05.337 --> 00:15:06.804
- Really?
- Yeah.

00:15:07.973 --> 00:15:12.034
Back then, Hiroki really did seem
like he wanted to come along.

00:15:13.078 --> 00:15:14.238
And yet...

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:45.738
I didn't know
what had happened.

00:15:45.778 --> 00:15:49.544
All I could think was,

00:15:49.581 --> 00:15:52.243
"I have to save Hiroki."

00:15:53.218 --> 00:15:54.708
When I came to...

00:15:56.455 --> 00:15:59.515
That was your awakening, right?

00:15:59.558 --> 00:16:01.651
But Hiroki was different.

00:16:01.694 --> 00:16:04.891
He was taken, just as he was,
to the hospital...

00:16:04.930 --> 00:16:08.661
...and I was told
that he couldn't be saved.

00:16:08.701 --> 00:16:12.660
After a while, I met Ryouko.

00:16:12.705 --> 00:16:16.402
I didn't care at all
about revenge.

00:16:16.442 --> 00:16:19.434
But if Hiroki could just be made
healthy again, then...

00:16:19.478 --> 00:16:20.911
Rokujo...

00:16:21.647 --> 00:16:26.277
The reason I played by myself
was because of Hiroki too...

00:16:26.318 --> 00:16:30.015
I felt bad for him,
since he couldn't play outside...

00:16:31.557 --> 00:16:34.355
I didn't know that...

00:16:37.396 --> 00:16:39.296
There was one strange thing.

00:16:39.331 --> 00:16:40.764
A strange thing?

00:16:40.799 --> 00:16:43.768
The phantom I saw
when I was inside of you...

00:16:43.802 --> 00:16:47.397
...looks really similar to the one
I saw when I was awakened.

00:16:47.439 --> 00:16:48.599
What?

00:16:49.942 --> 00:16:53.776
Are you saying that we have
the same phantom as our symbiont?

00:16:53.812 --> 00:16:55.279
I don't know...

00:16:55.314 --> 00:16:59.478
...but it might be why we're having
the same dream...

00:17:02.287 --> 00:17:03.948
I've found out where Taishi is!

00:17:03.989 --> 00:17:06.219
Ryouko.

00:17:06.258 --> 00:17:08.192
Where are Ranmaru
and Sakura?

00:17:08.227 --> 00:17:09.717
Well, you see...

00:17:09.762 --> 00:17:11.059
The apartment complex
in Machida?

00:17:11.096 --> 00:17:14.930
I'm sorry for letting them go off
on their own.

00:17:14.967 --> 00:17:17.765
She said that she just had to look
for Hiroki.

00:17:18.537 --> 00:17:19.970
This is bad.

00:17:20.005 --> 00:17:21.404
What's wrong?

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:23.601
Taishi is in Machida!

00:17:36.188 --> 00:17:39.157
Rokujo, it's not your fault.

00:17:40.993 --> 00:17:42.927
It's all their fault.

00:17:45.431 --> 00:17:46.921
Shindo.

00:17:48.200 --> 00:17:49.861
Rokujo...

00:18:03.182 --> 00:18:04.706
Hiroki!

00:18:07.152 --> 00:18:08.881
It's been a while
since I was last here.

00:18:09.922 --> 00:18:11.355
I'm not mad anymore.

00:18:11.390 --> 00:18:12.379
What?

00:18:12.424 --> 00:18:15.416
After all, you came to me,
big sister.

00:18:16.929 --> 00:18:19.397
Are you injuries all better now?

00:18:19.431 --> 00:18:24.164
I couldn't help it, you were all trying
to capture me.

00:18:24.203 --> 00:18:25.534
You...

00:18:26.738 --> 00:18:29.206
Big sister,
I'm in my right mind.

00:18:29.241 --> 00:18:30.538
Hiroki.

00:18:30.576 --> 00:18:31.565
Rokujo!

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:35.171
This is the form that the phantoms
evolved me into.

00:18:35.214 --> 00:18:36.943
Look, nothing's changed, right?

00:18:38.984 --> 00:18:40.451
You're the same, big sister.

00:18:40.486 --> 00:18:42.044
What?

00:18:42.087 --> 00:18:45.386
Someday, everyone will end up
like me.

00:18:45.424 --> 00:18:47.255
Don't be so high and mighty!

00:18:47.292 --> 00:18:48.987
You've been deceived
by the monsters!

00:18:50.028 --> 00:18:52.258
Are you all right if the people
get destroyed!?

00:18:52.297 --> 00:18:54.265
You're thinking small.

00:18:54.299 --> 00:18:55.391
What did you say!?

00:18:55.434 --> 00:18:57.163
The people aren't going
to be destroyed.

00:18:57.202 --> 00:18:59.136
They're going to be reborn.

00:18:59.171 --> 00:19:00.661
Into their evolved forms.

00:19:00.706 --> 00:19:04.267
You're saying the same things
Director Shiraishi said.

00:19:04.309 --> 00:19:05.640
Not quite.

00:19:05.677 --> 00:19:07.372
What!?

00:19:07.412 --> 00:19:10.677
I mean that the evolution doesn't
apply to just the physical body.

00:19:10.716 --> 00:19:13.913
That's what he was wrong about.

00:19:13.952 --> 00:19:17.649
When the spirit evolves, that's when
the evolution is complete.

00:19:17.689 --> 00:19:19.281
That's what I am.

00:19:25.664 --> 00:19:28.895
Hiroki, this is your present.

00:19:29.935 --> 00:19:35.635
It's the birthday present
that I bought for you.

00:19:35.674 --> 00:19:38.905
I'm sorry that I wasn't actually able
to give it to you.

00:19:38.944 --> 00:19:41.276
That's just trash.

00:19:43.182 --> 00:19:46.618
I've found something
that's more valuable.

00:19:46.652 --> 00:19:48.347
That's me as I am now.

00:19:52.424 --> 00:19:55.757
Rokujo, he's gone
completely crazy.

00:19:55.794 --> 00:19:57.455
I'll snap him out of it.

00:19:59.097 --> 00:20:01.497
You don't get it at all, do you?

00:20:01.533 --> 00:20:03.398
So what?

00:20:03.435 --> 00:20:04.561
You're pissing me off.

00:20:04.603 --> 00:20:05.934
What!?

00:20:05.971 --> 00:20:07.268
Die!

00:20:09.708 --> 00:20:11.539
Hiroki, stop it!

00:20:11.577 --> 00:20:13.272
You really aren't human,
are you?

00:20:16.415 --> 00:20:18.815
Don't get your hands dirty.

00:20:18.850 --> 00:20:21.114
Don't worry, just leave it to me!

00:20:25.757 --> 00:20:27.952
It's all right, I won't kill him!

00:20:32.364 --> 00:20:34.355
Shindo! Be careful!

00:20:40.472 --> 00:20:41.803
Shindo!

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:46.601
Big sister.

00:20:46.645 --> 00:20:49.808
You're... not Hiroki!

00:20:49.848 --> 00:20:53.215
To be honest... I was glad
to get the present...

00:20:54.820 --> 00:20:56.481
I'm glad I got to see you.

00:20:56.521 --> 00:20:57.954
Hiroki.

00:20:59.791 --> 00:21:01.452
Rokujo!

00:21:07.232 --> 00:21:08.221
Inukai!

00:21:08.267 --> 00:21:10.235
Sakura, get out of the way.

00:21:10.269 --> 00:21:14.296
I'll take care of Hiroki. So you...

00:21:14.339 --> 00:21:15.328
What?

00:21:16.808 --> 00:21:17.797
Damn it!

00:21:17.843 --> 00:21:19.333
Sakura.

00:21:19.378 --> 00:21:21.846
Don't blame yourself
any further.

00:21:22.881 --> 00:21:25.577
I can handle this by myself.

00:21:36.428 --> 00:21:37.690
Hiroki.

00:21:43.969 --> 00:21:45.027
Inukai!

00:21:51.076 --> 00:21:52.373
It can't be...

00:21:53.345 --> 00:21:55.313
Inuka...

00:21:55.347 --> 00:21:57.338
Hiro...

00:22:05.157 --> 00:22:06.818
Inukai...

00:22:09.628 --> 00:22:14.088
You still haven't found
your younger sister, right?

00:22:14.132 --> 00:22:15.861
Why?

00:22:15.901 --> 00:22:17.596
Why did you do this?

00:22:40.592 --> 00:22:45.495
I held that hand

00:22:45.530 --> 00:22:50.331
And we kissed

00:22:50.369 --> 00:22:55.170
After a little while

00:22:55.207 --> 00:23:00.110
It will quietly become
our final day

00:23:00.145 --> 00:23:06.573
Please, no matter what,
never forget

00:23:07.819 --> 00:23:10.219
Sherry, far away

00:23:10.255 --> 00:23:12.655
Sherry, it was with you

00:23:12.691 --> 00:23:17.594
That I laughed

00:23:17.629 --> 00:23:19.995
Sherry, far away

00:23:20.031 --> 00:23:22.431
Sherry, it was you

00:23:22.467 --> 00:23:27.097
That I held

00:23:27.139 --> 00:23:29.471
I sung the memories

00:23:29.508 --> 00:23:31.976
Forever melodies

00:23:32.010 --> 00:23:34.240
I sung the memories

00:23:36.982 --> 00:23:39.314
I sung the memories

